        "model": "GPT-6",
        "runId": "ada-en-f4e636b296c4",
        "wordAbsenceReason": "Word p80 describes the same excursion, but no exact complete block includes this RU wording, guide/ticket inclusion and second-night statement; RU-derived service language follows owner instruction."
